The declarations of main's `Flower.MkSlotsI.ClassForm` that depend on a vine-family carrier, copied by source (sha256 in
`Stage1MK/MkSlotsI/COPIED-SHA256SUMS`) onto the family `𝒱_γ` at `γ ≤ 1 / 2` (`Stage1MK/CONVENTIONS.md`): L5a's
prescribed points `Fama.VineA.PrescribedPrimeGarden γ`, L8's marked carrier and the item-I ports of L8 and its
helpers (names `Flower/tools/itool/names.json`). Everything else is main's, used by import. Generated by the
helper's `gen_si.py`. -/

